@startuml profile-api
title Profile API — 对齐后端
' PUT 创建/更新；重算/备份挂 /profile/*

actor User
participant "ProfilePageShell" as UI
participant "GET PUT /profile" as P
participant "POST .../validate" as V
participant "POST .../recompute-requests/*/preview" as Prev
participant "POST .../recompute-requests/*/confirm" as Conf
participant "GET POST /profile/backups*" as B

User -> UI : onboarding / save
UI -> V : optional
UI -> P : PUT + expectedProfileVersion
P --> UI : impactSummary + recomputeRequestId

User -> UI : confirm recompute
UI -> Prev : selectedScopes
Prev --> UI : roadmapPreviewToken
UI -> Conf : confirmRoadmapPreview
Conf --> UI : resultSummary

User -> UI : export / restore
UI -> B
B --> UI : backupId / restorePreview

@enduml
